WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.223 --> 00:00:02.277
(theme chime)

00:00:02.277 --> 00:00:04.994
- This week we are broadcasting
our shows in virtual reality

00:00:04.994 --> 00:00:07.533
thanks to our good friends at AT&amp;T.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:11.160
That's right, you can watch our show in VR

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.955
via Conan cardboard and other VR devices.

00:00:13.955 --> 00:00:18.511
We have four Conan 360 cameras
placed all over this theater.

00:00:18.511 --> 00:00:20.769
You can see the show from any angle.

00:00:20.769 --> 00:00:22.497
It's pretty impressive, show em Andy.

00:00:22.497 --> 00:00:24.533
- Alright, strapping in.

00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:26.970
- [Conan] Alright. (laughing)

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:29.083
- Alright, let's take it, oh, hi Conan.

00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:30.589
- Yeah, hey Andy, how's it going?

00:00:30.589 --> 00:00:33.197
- [Andy] Oh look at how big you look.

00:00:33.197 --> 00:00:34.645
- [Conan] Yeah. (audience laughs)

00:00:34.645 --> 00:00:37.165
- Let's cycle through the
cameras so people can see.

00:00:37.165 --> 00:00:38.272
- [Conan] That's pretty impressive.

00:00:38.272 --> 00:00:40.216
- Yeah, yeah, okay, there it is.

00:00:40.216 --> 00:00:41.049
(audience cheers)

00:00:41.049 --> 00:00:42.731
Get a little vertigo going.

00:00:42.731 --> 00:00:43.643
(audience cheers louder)

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:47.536
Whoa, oh yeah, now this is a good way.

00:00:47.536 --> 00:00:50.858
Hey buddy, what's going on pal?

00:00:50.858 --> 00:00:52.804
(Conan and audience laugh)

00:00:52.804 --> 00:00:54.542
Hey guy, how you doing?

00:00:54.542 --> 00:00:56.399
- [Conan] Refuses to
acknowledge you in any way.

00:00:56.399 --> 00:00:57.232
- [Andy] What's going on buddy?

00:00:57.232 --> 00:00:59.291
- [Conan] Nope, refuses to
acknowledge you in any way.

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:02.526
- [Andy] Yeah yeah, hi friend,
what's your name, buddy?

00:01:02.526 --> 00:01:06.196
- [Conan] Very nice. (audience laughs)

00:01:06.196 --> 00:01:08.394
Clearly someone fleeing
the long arm of the law.

00:01:08.394 --> 00:01:09.737
- [Andy] Someone's a little shy.

00:01:09.737 --> 00:01:11.506
- [Conan] Someone who hasn't
paid taxes in 10 years.

00:01:11.506 --> 00:01:13.007
- [Andy] Wait, go back to the
other one cause I wanna get--

00:01:13.007 --> 00:01:16.002
- [Conan] Oh look at that!
- [Andy] Oh there's me!

00:01:16.002 --> 00:01:17.536
- [Conan] Wow, yeah.

00:01:17.536 --> 00:01:19.499
- [Andy] Aww, I could lose a few.

00:01:19.499 --> 00:01:21.055
(audience cheers)

00:01:21.055 --> 00:01:23.863
Well there you have it, this
is what you get to do at home.

00:01:23.863 --> 00:01:26.530
Oh hi, you brought your luggage.

00:01:28.299 --> 00:01:31.483
- [Conan] Okay, Andy you
look like an idiot. (laughs)

00:01:31.483 --> 00:01:33.276
(audience laughs)

00:01:33.276 --> 00:01:36.109
- I do, oh my god, I
just saw myself, I do!

00:01:36.109 --> 00:01:38.585
- [Conan] Yeah. (audience laughs)

00:01:38.585 --> 00:01:41.162
Anyway it's as if you're in
the actual theater, Andy.

00:01:41.162 --> 00:01:44.374
- It really is, it's so much more real

00:01:44.374 --> 00:01:45.779
than actually being here.

00:01:45.779 --> 00:01:49.298
- Yeah, now those of you
at home with headsets

00:01:49.298 --> 00:01:51.872
can go to teamcoco.com/360 to experience

00:01:51.872 --> 00:01:53.526
all of this if you like.

00:01:53.526 --> 00:01:56.540
Thanks to our friends at
AT&amp;T for sponsoring Conan360.

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:58.400
We're gonna take a quick
break, when we come back,

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.717
the cast of Silicon Valley is here!

